**Step-by-Step Explanation and Answer:**

The student opens lockers in a back-and-forth pattern, starting from locker 1 and alternating between opening and skipping lockers. After the first pass, all odd-numbered lockers are open. On his return pass, he opens the even-numbered lockers starting from the highest (1024) and working his way down to 2. Thus, the last locker he opens is locker number 2.

**Answer:** \boxed{2}
